 after purchase\n2. Click the link in the PDF\n3. For best results, create an additional copy of the templates to duplicate any pages within the template file.\n4. Use the template over and over again to create multiple printables.\n5. Print your planner with an online printer, a local print shop, or a high-quality home printer.\n\nThis is a digital product. No physical item will be sent to you.\nThank you for your visit!",
